<footer class="gh-footer{{#match @custom.header_and_footer_color "Accent color"}} has-accent-color{{/match}} gh-outer">
    <style>
    .uz-blog-purpose { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 48px; padding: 40px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
    .uz-blog-purpose h2 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: var(--gh-font-heading, var(--font-sans)); font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 2.2vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .uz-blog-purpose p { margin: 0 0 16px; max-width: 64ch; font-size: 1.7rem; line-height: 1.65; }
    .uz-blog-purpose p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .uz-blog-purpose a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .2em; }
    .uz-blog-purpose a:hover { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
    .uz-blog-purpose a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid currentColor; outline-offset: 5px; border-radius: 2px; }
    .uz-blog-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 24px; margin-top: 16px; }
    .uz-blog-links a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; font-size: 1.5rem; }
    .gh-footer .gh-footer-bar { margin-bottom: 56px; }
    .gh-footer .gh-footer-signup { padding-bottom: 72px; }
    @media (max-width: 767px) { .uz-blog-purpose { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 28px; padding: 32px 0; } }
</style>
    <div class="gh-footer-inner gh-inner">

        <section class="uz-blog-purpose" aria-labelledby="uz-blog-purpose-title">
            <div>
                <h2 id="uz-blog-purpose-title">The work, and how it gets made.</h2>
                <p>This blog showcases Uzelhub&rsquo;s products and the skill behind putting AI to work. The blog itself is part of that work.</p>
                <p>Daniel Shorter directs AI agents and tools to turn development history into articles and diagrams, then reviews and shapes what gets published. That coordination of tools, tasks, and human judgment is AI orchestration.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p>Curious what else this approach can do? Explore <a href="https://uzelhub.com/">UzelHub.com</a> for the working systems, the agents behind them, and the decisions that shaped them.</p>
                <nav class="uz-blog-links" aria-label="Explore Uzelhub">
                    <a href="https://uzelhub.com/products/">Solutions</a>
                    <a href="https://uzelhub.com/agents/">Agents</a>
                    <a href="https://uzelhub.com/notes/">Field notes</a>
                    <a href="https://uzelhub.com/about.html">About</a>
                    <a href="https://uzelhub.com/contact.html">Contact</a>
                    <a href="https://blog.uzelhub.com/rss/">RSS feed</a>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="gh-footer-bar">
            <span class="gh-footer-logo is-title">
                {{#if @site.logo}}
                    <img src="{{@site.logo}}" alt="{{@site.title}}">
                {{else}}
                    {{@site.title}}
                {{/if}}
            </span>
            <nav class="gh-footer-menu">
                {{navigation type="secondary"}}
            </nav>
            <div class="gh-footer-copyright">
                Powered by <a href="https://ghost.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ghost</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        {{#if @site.members_enabled}}
            {{#unless @member}}
                <section class="gh-footer-signup">
                    <h2 class="gh-footer-signup-header is-title">
                        {{#if @custom.signup_heading}}{{@custom.signup_heading}}{{else}}Follow the work{{/if}}
                    </h2>
                    <p class="gh-footer-signup-subhead is-body">
                        {{#if @custom.signup_subheading}}{{@custom.signup_subheading}}{{else}}New articles on the systems, the decisions, and the work behind them.{{/if}}
                    </p>
                    {{> "email-subscription" email_field_id="footer-email"}}
                </section>
            {{/unless}}
        {{/if}}

    </div>
</footer>